# DRY With Judgment

- Do not duplicate business rules (continuity, settlement, tier logic) — centralize in API services.
- Do not extract one-off helpers or premature abstractions "for future use."
- Three similar lines beat a wrong generic framework.
- Shared types belong in `packages/shared/` only when used by both web and api.
- Domain truth lives in `docs/` and skills — link, don't copy long passages into code comments.
